Slurm GPU Docs: Introduction
---

The documentation will just be pure text files that is fed into `less` viewer (`man less` for more details). The documentation will be written similar to markdown files. Backticks (`) denote commands you can type, "(!)" symbol is important information and ">" indicates what the command will print. The list of pages:

* Introduction
* Architecture
* LinuxMachines
* Tickets
* Slurm
* GPUTypes
* Limits
* Etiquette
* Examples
* Cheatsheet

Any suggestions to make the docs better are appreciated! Don't be afraid to reach out, it will only help other people in the future.
